        "valueString": "Rash for 5 days on both flexor forearms and a few spots on the anterior neck; itching especially at night and kept the patient awake. Loratadine taken for two doses with partial relief. No previous similar rash."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
