          "text": "Skin examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Erythematous, slightly raised papules/thin plaques on both flexor forearms, some excoriations, and a sharp T-shirt-line cutoff. A few similar papules on the anterior neck above the collar. No vesicles, crust, pustules, target lesions, or urticaria."
      }
